Most 'best screen time app' lists compare how strict each app is and what it costs. We added a different question: what does the pause actually ask of you? A breath, a reflection, or just a wait?

The gentle options on iPhone are one sec, ScreenZen, Inscreen, Jomo and Apple's Screen Time used as a soft reminder. Most also have optional strict modes, so the settings you start with matter. In one small University of Michigan study, 62% of people kept gentle interventions on, compared with 36% for a timed lockout.

